<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39569" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπικαρπ-ία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>produce, crop</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἐπέτειος ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				955d
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12.328.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Rev.Ét.Gr.</u>
				10.29
			</span></i> (Thespiae, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. <i>harvest-rights</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Tab.Heracl.</u>
				1.108
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				101.19
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>; <i>usufruct</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ
				ἐκ τῆς γῆς ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				3.58
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>.
			<i>revenue</i> from property, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Leg.Gort.</u>
				7.33
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς ἐκ</span>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταύτης</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς ὠνῆσ̓ ἐπικαρπίας . . ἐνενήκοντα μνᾶς
			ἐκλέξας</span> having collected <i><span class="en">
				90
			</span></i> minae as the <i>revenue</i> from this tax, <i><span class="en">
				And.
				1.92
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>profit</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1258b24
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ ἐ</span>. the
			<i>profits</i>, opp. the principal (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ</span>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρχαῖα</span>), <i><span class="en">
				D.
				27.50
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπικαρπίας λαμβάνειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					8.125
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆθεν ἀναμένοντι</span>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἐ</span>. looking to the land for his
				<i>profits,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Com.Adesp.
				133.3
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἐ. τῶν</span>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁδρῶν</span> the <i>profits</i> on the
			full-grown animals, <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				20
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>.
			<i>tithe</i> paid for the pasturage of cattle, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				1346a3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>6.</b>. metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρρησίας ἐπικαρπίαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					39.10
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κινδύνων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Onos.
					34.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ πόνου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					2.8
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
